Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 14:48:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 19/23] feat(vr): Phase 4 stub - ImGui to texture and stage
 billboard

Add Dear ImGui via FetchContent, render a minimal window to an FBO, and draw it as a world-space quad in the stereo pass. VR continues if overlay init fails.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

